{"suttaId":"snp5.3","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Sn","vriCode":"s0505m.mul","paras":[3552,3564],"vripara":"1046"},"segments":{"snp5.3:0.2":"Tissametteyyamāṇavapucchā","snp5.3:1.1":"“Kodha santusito loke,","snp5.3:1.2":"(iccāyasmā tissametteyyo)","snp5.3:1.3":"Kassa no santi iñjitā;","snp5.3:1.4":"Ko ubhantamabhiññāya,","snp5.3:1.5":"majjhe mantā na lippati [limpati (ka.)];","snp5.3:1.6":"Kaṃ brūsi mahāpurisoti,","snp5.3:1.7":"ko idha sibbinimaccagā”. 1047.","snp5.3:2.1":"“Kāmesu brahmacariyavā,","snp5.3:2.2":"(metteyyāti bhagavā)","snp5.3:2.3":"Vītataṇho sadā sato;","snp5.3:2.4":"Saṅkhāya nibbuto bhikkhu,","snp5.3:2.5":"tassa no santi iñjitā. 1048.","snp5.3:3.1":"“So ubhantamabhiññāya,","snp5.3:3.2":"majjhe mantā na lippati;","snp5.3:3.3":"Taṃ brūmi mahāpurisoti,","snp5.3:3.4":"so idha sibbinimaccagā”ti.","snp5.3:3.5":"Tissametteyyamāṇavapucchā dutiyā niṭṭhitā. 3."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Pj-ii","bookName":"Suttanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0505a.att","from":2536,"to":2536,"paras":[{"para":2536,"vripara":null,"refs":["snp5.3:2"],"lines":["Niṭṭhite pana ajitapañhe “kathaṃ lokaṃ avekkhantaṃ, maccurājā na passatī”ti (su. ni. 1124; cūḷani. piṅgiyamāṇavapucchā 144) evaṃ mogharājā pucchituṃ ārabhi.","Taṃ “na tāvassa indriyāni paripākaṃ gatānī”ti ñatvā bhagavā “tiṭṭha tvaṃ, mogharāja, añño pucchatū”ti paṭikkhipi.","Tato tissametteyyo attano saṃsayaṃ pucchanto <b>“kodhā”</b>ti gāthamāha.","Tattha <b>kodha santussito</b>ti ko idha tuṭṭho.","<b>Iñjitā</b>ti taṇhādiṭṭhivipphanditāni.","<b>Ubhantamabhiññāyā</b>ti ubho ante abhijānitvā.","<b>Mantā na lippatī</b>ti paññāya na lippati. 1048-9."],"lineRefs":[["snp5.3:2"],["snp5.3:2"],["snp5.3:2"],["snp5.3:2"],["snp5.3:2"],["snp5.3:2"],["snp5.3:2"]]}],"wordLinks":[["snp5.3:2.4","iñjitā",0,4]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
